{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BE A CAT and SAVE YOUR HUMAN from the GREEBLES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/1207_1_.gif?t=1743713388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Itty Bitty Toilet Kitty you get to play as a cute feline who must protect their owner from the flesh eating toilet monsters - GREEBLES. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/1207_3_.gif?t=1743713388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase, jump and slash them down, until there are none left. It's simple but chaotically cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/1207_4_.gif?t=1743713388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play  a short story ending with an epic boss fight in which you'll test all your kitty clawing skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/1207_7_.gif?t=1743713388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Art and a Retro soundtrack, Itty-Bitty Toilet Kitty is a micro game with a big kitty bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/1207_9_.gif?t=1743713388\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049450?t=1743713388","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049450?t=1743713388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/f4e05823dcb67cc4c781cf66d6f1936b5c94042b/c